post.summary:
Closes a review request. `overturned`: a refused text becomes `accepted` and resumes the
pipeline (duplicate detection, re-analysis or report review), a masked idea is republished;
`confirmed`: the decision stands and the suspended purge resumes.

idea_withdrawn.description:
The idea concerned by this contribution, report or merged duplicate was withdrawn by its
author (§7.1): show « Idée retirée par son auteur » (`idea` is then `null`). Always sent;
declared optional so that clients built before it keep compiling.
